      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我還想買幾包薯片……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ hái xiǎng mǎi jǐ bāo shǔ piàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, I want to buy a few more bags of chips…"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你不是已经拿了一包了吗？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你不是已經拿了一包了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ bú shì yǐ jīng ná le yì bāo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Didn’t you take one already?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：可是，这些是新出的口味。",
      "traditional": "小明：可是，這些是新出的口味。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng kě shì zhè xiē shì xīn chū de kǒu wèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: But, these are new flavors."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈：什么口味？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：什麼口味？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shén me kǒu wèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: What are the flavors?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明：你看，牛油果味和小龙虾味，看起来很好吃！",
      "traditional": "小明：你看，牛油果味和小龍蝦味，看起來很好吃！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nǐ kàn niú yóu guǒ wèi hé xiǎo lóng xiā wèi kàn qǐ lái hěn hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Look, avocado flavor and crayfish flavor, they look delicious!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "妈妈：好吧，每种口味只能拿一包。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：好吧，每種口味只能拿一包。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma hǎo ba měi zhǒng kǒu wèi zhǐ néng ná yì bāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Ok, you can only take one bag of each flavor."
    }
